# tests/winterfest/wf_scenario.commands
#
# Console commands cs16-linux-base sends after the map starts, one per line,
# 0.4 s apart. This is the operator/admin half of the brief: the same commands a
# person would type on the server console.
#
# The scenario plugin proves the ledger logic through natives; these lines prove
# the console path reaches the same functions and says so in the log (the
# wf_scenario.expect file asserts each of these lines).

wf_force_open 1
wf_give all snowflakes 0 40
wf_state all
wf_give nobody-at-all snowflakes 0 5
wf_reload
wf_dump_spawns
